==Battleground==
===<u>Chapters 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Snache|Those Guys|Hippoe|Doge|Shibalien}}
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Shibalien]] spawns.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hippoe|Snache|Those Guys|Doge|Shibalien}}
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Shibalien]] spawns.

==Strategy==
As this is the 2nd stage of Into the Future, spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat/Crazed Giraffe Cat]] is more than enough to go for a high score.

